    "name": "Unrelated Business Income Tax (UBIT)",
    "category": "Accounting",
    "description": "Regulates unrelated business income, which is income from a trade or business, regularly carried on, that is not substantially related to the charitable, educational, or other purpose that is the basis of the organization's exemption.",
