    "name": "Higher Education Act: Program Participation Agreements",
    "category": "Copyright & Trademark",
    "description": "Requires institutions to certify, as part of their annual Program Participation Agreement, that they have: 1) developed plans to combat the unauthorized use of copyrighted material; and 2) will, to the extent practicable, offer alternatives to illegal file sharing. The regulations require periodic review of the plan to determine its effectiveness.",
