    "description": "Permits an instructor to display virtually all types of works during on-line instruction at accredited nonprofit educational institutions without consent of copyright owner, provided that instruction is mediated by an instructor, transmission is intended only for students enrolled in course, and measures are employed to prevent redistribution of transmission and prevent its retention for longer than the class session.",
