    "category": "Disabilities",
    "description": "Entitles eligible employees of covered employers to take unpaid, job-protected leave for specified family and medical reasons with continuation of group health insurance coverage under the same terms and conditions as if the employee had not taken leave.\n\n \tProvides covered employees with certain rights to reinstatement of employment after taking FMLA leave.",
