    "name": "Chemical Facility Anti-Terrorism Standards",
    "category": "Environmental Health and Safety",
    "description": "This rule establishes risk-based performance standards for the security of the nation's chemical facilities.\n\n \tIt requires covered chemical facilities to prepare Security Vulnerability Assessments, which identify facility security vulnerabilities, and to develop and implement Site Security Plans, which include measures that satisfy the identified risk-based performance standards.",
