  "Expor-1638-XXXX": {
    "id": "Expor-1638-XXXX",
    "name": "International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR)",
    "category": "Export Controls",
    "description": "The International Traffic in Arms Regulations govern the export of defense articles and defense services, i.e. those items with a military application.  The licensing conditions for materials covered as military products and technology are set forth at  22 U.S.C. § 2778.\n\n \tThe Department of State administers this law.",
