  "Gover-16031659-XXXX": {
    "id": "Gover-16031659-XXXX",
    "name": "Federal Sentencing Guidelines",
    "category": "Governance",
    "description": "The guidelines at §8B2.1 set forth the requirements for an effective compliance and ethics program for organizations. Organizations are vicariously liable under federal criminal law for acts committed by their agents. The definition of \"organization\" at 18 U.S.C. §18 includes non-profits such as a university.",
