  "Grant-1735-XXXX": {
    "id": "Grant-1735-XXXX",
    "name": "Regulation Grant-1735-XXXX",
    "category": "Grants Management",
    "description": "Intended to make available in a single document the general terms and conditions of HHS discretionary grant and cooperative agreement awards.\n\n \tThis policy statement applies only to HHS discretionary grant programs and only to awards to organizational entities made by Operating Divisions other than the National Institutes of Health (NIH). It does not apply to awards under mandatory grant programs (e.g., entitlement programs) or to awards made directly to individuals (e.g., scholarships).",
